================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
================================================================================

This MIT licence covers ONLY the source code, documentation, configuration,
generated figures, and the run archive -- results/runs.jsonl and
results/aggregated_metrics.json -- in this repository.

Those two files under results/ are measurements of the author's own training runs:
training hyper-parameters, and per-epoch loss and pixel-error curves. They contain
no image, no image-derived array, no per-image value and no identifier. They record
how the models behaved, not the content of the corpus the models were trained on.
See docs/dataset.md and SECURITY.md.

It does NOT cover, and cannot grant any right to:

  1. THE DATASET.
     The imaging data used to produce these results is licensed research
     material and is not distributed here. It is governed by the terms of its
     own source, which at the time of writing is a Creative Commons
     BY-NC-SA 3.0 licence plus the repository's own ground rules, including a
     prohibition on re-posting protected data elsewhere and on incorporating it
     into commercial products. See docs/dataset.md. Obtaining and using the data
     is between you and its provider; nothing in this repository grants you any
     right to it.

  2. PRETRAINED MODEL WEIGHTS.
     ViTPose and ViTPose++ checkpoints are distributed by their own authors
     under their own terms. See docs/dataset.md for provenance.

No patient imagery, no image derived from patient imagery, and no patient
identifier is contained in this repository. See SECURITY.md.
